          "title": "You'll want to know: ತೇಗು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೇಗು — tēgu — \"to belch; to burp\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಊಟದ ನಂತರ ಮಗು ತೇಗಿತು. ūṭada nantara magu tēgitu. After the meal the baby burped."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ತೇಗಿದೆ, tēgide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೇಗು (tēgu) is also the burp itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೇಗು (tēgu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3451 lists Kannada tēgu, tēku, \"to belch; a belch\", beside Tamil tēkku."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
