          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಏದುಸಿರು ಬಿಡು — ēdusiru biḍu — \"to pant; to gasp\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮೆಟ್ಟಿಲು ಹತ್ತಿ ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಏದುಸಿರು ಬಿಟ್ಟರು. meṭṭilu hatti ajji ēdusiru biṭṭaru. Grandmother panted after climbing the stairs."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಏದುಸಿರು ಬಿಟ್ಟೆ, ēdusiru biṭṭe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಏದುಸಿರು is panting breath, built on ಉಸಿರು, breath; ಬಿಡು, to let out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಏದುಸಿರು ಬಿಡು (ēdusiru biḍu) is a native Kannada phrase: usiru, \"breath\" (DEDR 645), and biḍu, \"to let go\" (DEDR 5393). The origin of the first part, ēd-, is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
